-- This entire file is the configuration, not a patch to the previous version.
AGENT designer WITH "Plan task implementations and report missing information.";
AGENT coder WITH "Implement concrete tasks and report test evidence.";
AGENT reviewer WITH "Independently review implementation and test evidence. Mark tasks validated only when their requirements are met.";
TAG design/frontend WITH "Frontend work. Verify keyboard navigation and accessibility.";
TAG src/linear WITH "Use Linear only if the current server has access to it.";

ON PLANNING WHEN TAGGED src/linear PING designer;
ON TODO WHEN TAGGED design/* PING coder;
AFTER designer WHEN NOT TAGGED src/* PING coder;
AFTER coder PING reviewer;
AFTER VALIDATED STOP PINGING designer;
AFTER VALIDATED STOP PINGING coder;
AFTER VALIDATED STOP PINGING reviewer;

-- A standalone triage session, with no task (namespace-isolated when selected).
EVERY 10 MINUTES
    PING designer WITH "Inspect open tasks; identify blockers and create follow-up work if needed.";
